               <p xml:id="idm137">Hartmann's original draft contains thirteen movements, of which nine are included in the printed version, one was published as "Aftenstemning" (HartW 113), one is a discarded early version and two were published in "Musikblade udgivne af Foreningen Fremtiden" as "Allegro agitato for Pianoforte" (HartW 110) and "Andante cantabile for Pianoforte" (HartW 111).</p>
